    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48063" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">textūra</span></b> , ae, f.
		texo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a web</i>, <i>texture</i> (very rare).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aranearum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Stich. 2, 2, 24</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Minervae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
				4</span></i>
			 (5), 5, 23; <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 121,
			22</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a
			construction</i>, <i>structure</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quam tenui constet texturā (animi
					natura),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					3, 209</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Luc. 9, 777</span></i>.</div>
